{
  "_comment": [
    "Load-test the settlement app's Transfer choice. Nothing here is directly",
    "creatable: the setup program opens accounts through a factory, issues an",
    "instrument, and credits holdings — binding each product to a name the next",
    "step (and the measured mix) references as $ref:<name>.",
    "",
    "Run it:  node src/cli.ts run examples/settlement-app/.daml/dist/canton-stress-settlement-0.1.0.dar \\",
    "           --workload-file examples/settlement-app/workload.json --sandbox --ops 100 --concurrency 8"
  ],

  "version": 1,
  "parties": 6,
  "roles": ["custodian", "issuer"],

  "setup": [
    {
      "id": "factory",
      "actAs": ["$role:custodian"],
      "op": {
        "kind": "create",
        "template": "#canton-stress-settlement:Settlement:AccountFactory",
        "args": { "custodian": "$role:custodian" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "instrument",
      "actAs": ["$role:issuer"],
      "op": {
        "kind": "create",
        "template": "#canton-stress-settlement:Settlement:Instrument",
        "args": { "issuer": "$role:issuer", "custodian": "$role:custodian", "symbol": "USD" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "accounts",
      "count": 6,
      "actAs": ["$role:custodian"],
      "op": {
        "kind": "exercise",
        "template": "#canton-stress-settlement:Settlement:AccountFactory",
        "contract": "$ref:factory",
        "choice": "OpenAccount",
        "args": { "owner": "$pi" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "holdings",
      "count": 24,
      "actAs": ["$role:custodian"],
      "op": {
        "kind": "exercise",
        "template": "#canton-stress-settlement:Settlement:Account",
        "contract": "$ref:accounts[$i]",
        "choice": "Credit",
        "args": { "instrument": "$ref:instrument", "amount": "1000.0" }
      }
    }
  ],

  "operations": [
    {
      "weight": 8,
      "_comment": [
        "Settle a holding into another party's account. The destination is a",
        "contract SETUP created, and actAsFrom reads the holding's real owner",
        "off the target so the transfer is signed by whoever actually holds it.",
        "The custodian co-submits because the sender is not a stakeholder of",
        "the destination account and could not otherwise see it."
      ],
      "op": {
        "kind": "exercise",
        "template": "#canton-stress-settlement:Settlement:Holding",
        "choice": "Transfer",
        "actAsFrom": ["owner"],
        "args": { "newAccount": "$ref:accounts[*]" }
      },
      "submit": { "actAs": ["$role:custodian"] }
    },
    {
      "weight": 2,
      "op": {
        "kind": "exercise",
        "template": "#canton-stress-settlement:Settlement:Holding",
        "choice": "Split",
        "actAsFrom": ["owner"],
        "args": { "splitAmount": "1.0" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
